# Swift Package Manager
# NOTE: the SwiftPM `Packages/` pattern is intentionally omitted — on a
# case-insensitive filesystem (macOS default) it matches this monorepo's
# lowercase `packages/` and silently ignores every newly added package file.
# This repo has no Swift code; re-add an anchored pattern if that changes.
.build/
Package.pins
Package.resolved
*.swiftpm

